# Google Calendar API key — used by FullCalendar to fetch events client-side.
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a project (or select an existing one)
# 3. Enable "Google Calendar API" under APIs & Services → Library
# 4. Create an API key under APIs & Services → Credentials
# 5. Restrict the key: Application restrictions → HTTP referrers → add carobotics.org/*
#    API restrictions → Restrict key → select "Google Calendar API"
# 6. Copy the key below and save this file as .env (git-ignored)
PUBLIC_GCAL_API_KEY=
